#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Choose Configure service actions from a folder or item menu. Enable each installed action you trust, then Save. Matching enabled actions appear under Service actions; uncheck them to disable them. Changed definitions must be enabled again.\n- KDE service menus are read from kio/servicemenus and kservices5/ServiceMenus in XDG data folders. Executable Nautilus scripts are read from your XDG data folder’s nautilus/scripts directory. Installing or downloading scripts is your choice; OpenXplorer does neither automatically.\n- Selected paths are passed as separate arguments. Terminal launchers, interpreter commands and embedded field substitutions are unsupported. Scripts receive the selected paths and URIs and current-folder URI through Nautilus environment variables."
msgstr "- 从文件夹或项目菜单中选择“配置服务操作”。启用你信任的每个已安装操作，然后点击保存。匹配到的已启用操作会显示在“服务操作”下；取消勾选即可禁用。修改过的定义需要重新启用。\n- KDE 服务菜单读取自 XDG 数据文件夹中的 kio/servicemenus 和 kservices5/ServiceMenus。可执行的 Nautilus 脚本读取自 XDG 数据文件夹的 nautilus/scripts 目录。安装或下载脚本由你自行决定；OpenXplorer 不会自动做这两件事。\n- 选中的路径会作为独立参数传递。终端启动器、解释器命令和嵌入式字段替换不受支持。脚本通过 Nautilus 环境变量获取选中的路径和 URI 以及当前文件夹 URI。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Choose Open as administrator on a local folder’s menu, confirm, then retry the operation in that folder. You can also enter an admin:/// address explicitly. GVfs requests desktop authentication through polkit; OpenXplorer itself stays unprivileged. This requires your distribution’s GVfs administrator backend."
msgstr "- 在本地文件夹的菜单中选择“以管理员身份打开”，确认后在该文件夹中重试操作。你也可以直接输入 admin:/// 地址。GVfs 通过 polkit 请求桌面认证；OpenXplorer 自身始终以非特权身份运行。这需要你的发行版提供 GVfs 管理员后端。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Ctrl+, opens Settings, which has its own search box.\n- OpenXplorer uses the network only for locations you open, server discovery you start and the update check you ask for. It has no telemetry.\n- Recent files and Recent locations follow your desktop’s history privacy settings. Clear recent locations on its sidebar menu removes folder history while keeping recent files."
msgstr "- Ctrl+, 打开“设置”，其中自带搜索框。\n- OpenXplorer 只在打开位置、发起服务器发现和你要检查更新时使用网络。它不含遥测。\n- “最近使用的文件”和“最近去过的位置”遵循你桌面的历史记录隐私设置。在侧边栏菜单中清除最近去过的位置会删除文件夹历史，同时保留最近使用的文件。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Ctrl+F or Ctrl+E moves to the search box. Typing there filters the folder you are in.\n- Folders you choose can be cached for search: right-click a folder and choose Cache this folder for search. Only names and paths are stored, on this computer; no file contents are read.\n- Open file location (on a result's menu) opens the folder that holds it, with the result selected."
msgstr "- Ctrl+F 或 Ctrl+E 会跳到搜索框。在其中输入即可筛选你当前所在的文件夹。\n- 你选择的文件夹可以缓存以便搜索：右键单击文件夹并选择“为搜索缓存此文件夹”。只在本机上存储名称和路径；不会读取任何文件内容。\n- “打开文件位置”（位于结果的菜单中）会打开包含该结果的文件夹，并选中该结果。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Deleted items go to the Recycle Bin of their drive. Restore puts them back where they were.\n- Empty Recycle Bin deletes everything in it permanently, after asking."
msgstr "- 删除的项目会进入所在驱动器的回收站。还原会把它们放回原来的位置。\n- “清空回收站”会在询问后永久删除其中的所有内容。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- New in the command bar creates a folder, a document from the built-in starters, or a file from your Templates folder.\n- Cut, Copy and Paste work with other file managers. Paste on one selected folder pastes into that folder.\n- Rename with F2. Select several items to rename them together.\n- Delete or Ctrl+D moves items to the Recycle Bin; Shift+Delete deletes them permanently after asking. Locations without a Recycle Bin offer a confirmed permanent delete.\n- When a name is already taken, OpenXplorer asks whether to replace, skip or keep both. Nothing is replaced without your answer.\n- Undo (Ctrl+Z) and Redo (Ctrl+Y) reverse the last operations.\n- Copies and moves show processed bytes and speed; a total and estimated time remaining appear when the total is known. Pause, Resume and Cancel apply to each job; finished items stay finished.\n- Up to four copy, move or delete jobs can run while you browse. Wait for a job using overlapping source or destination folders to finish before starting another. Archive operations, renaming, restore and Undo remain exclusive."
msgstr "- 命令栏中的“新建”可创建文件夹、基于内置起始模板的文档，或来自你的“模板”文件夹的文件。\n- “剪切”“复制”和“粘贴”可与其他文件管理器互通。在选中的单个文件夹上粘贴会粘贴到该文件夹中。\n- 按 F2 重命名。选中多个项目可以一起重命名。\n- “删除”或 Ctrl+D 会把项目移到回收站；Shift+Delete 会在询问后永久删除它们。没有回收站的位置会提供需确认的永久删除。\n- 名称已被占用时，OpenXplorer 会询问是替换、跳过还是两者都保留。在你做出选择前不会替换任何内容。\n- “撤销”（Ctrl+Z）和“重做”（Ctrl+Y）可反向执行最近的操作。\n- 复制和移动会显示已处理的字节数和速度；已知总量时还会显示总量和预计剩余时间。“暂停”“继续”和“取消”按每个任务生效；已完成的项目保持完成状态。\n- 浏览时最多可同时运行四个复制、移动或删除任务。源位置或目标位置有重叠的任务需等其结束后再开始新任务。压缩包操作、重命名、还原和撤销仍为独占执行。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Open Network in the navigation pane, or type an address such as smb://server/share, to browse a share.\n- Map network location in More options saves a share in the navigation pane.\n- OpenXplorer asks for your user name and password when a server needs them, and can keep the password in your desktop's keyring.\n- Right-click a share or server and choose Sign out of server to disconnect and forget a session."
msgstr "- 在导航窗格中打开“网络”，或输入诸如 smb://server/share 的地址，即可浏览共享。\n- “更多选项”中的“映射网络位置”可把共享保存在导航窗格中。\n- 服务器需要时，OpenXplorer 会询问你的用户名和密码，并可将密码保存在你桌面的密钥环中。\n- 右键单击共享或服务器并选择“退出服务器登录”，即可断开连接并忘记该会话。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Properties > Previous versions lists snapshots that your file system or server already exposes. Browse opens one read-only; Restore a copy writes a separate copy and never replaces the original."
msgstr "- “属性”>“以前的版本”会列出你的文件系统或服务器已提供的快照。“浏览”会以只读方式打开其中一个；“还原副本”会写入单独的副本，绝不替换原始文件。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- Report an issue (in this Help window and in About this build) opens the project's issue tracker in your browser. Please describe what you did, what you expected and what happened, and leave out private file names."
msgstr "- “报告问题”（位于本帮助窗口和“关于此版本”中）会在浏览器中打开项目的问题跟踪器。请描述你做了什么、期望什么以及发生了什么，并且不要包含私人文件名。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- This PC lists drives, USB sticks and connected phones. Click one to open it; it is mounted when needed.\n- Use Eject or Safely remove on a drive's menu before unplugging it."
msgstr "- 此电脑列出驱动器、USB 存储设备和已连接的手机。单击其中一个即可打开；需要时会自动挂载。\n- 拔下驱动器前，先在其菜单中使用“弹出”或“安全删除”。"

#: crates/ox-app/resources/manual.md
msgid "- View switches between Details, Compact list and icon sizes; its slider and Ctrl+mouse wheel adjust the size.\n- F3 toggles two panes in one tab. Click the pane you want to work in; the address bar and commands follow it.\n- View can show a folder tree, enable previews and group items. Folder views can keep their own layout and sorting, or share the default selected in Settings.\n- Sort offers name, modified and created dates, type, extension, size and further metadata. In Details, click a column heading to sort; the heading menu chooses visible columns, and headings can be reordered.\n- In Details, expand a folder to browse its contents in place. Preview settings control network files and the maximum file size.\n- Right-click empty space in a folder for View, Sort by, New, Paste and the folder's other commands.\n- Ctrl+H shows or hides hidden files. Alt+Shift+P or Alt+P shows the details pane, F9 the navigation pane.\n- F11 shows the window full screen; press it again to get the window back as it was.\n- Ctrl+plus, Ctrl+minus and Ctrl+0 change the text size."
msgstr "- 视图可在详细信息、紧凑列表和图标大小之间切换；其滑块和 Ctrl+鼠标滚轮可调整大小。\n- F3 在一个标签页中切换双窗格。单击要操作的窗格；地址栏和命令会跟随它。\n- 视图可显示文件夹树、启用预览并对项目分组。文件夹视图可保留自己的布局和排序，也可共享在设置中选择的默认值。\n- 排序提供名称、修改日期和创建日期、类型、扩展名、大小以及更多元数据。在详细信息中，单击列标题即可排序；标题菜单用于选择显示的列，标题也可重新排序。\n- 在详细信息中，可展开文件夹以就地浏览其内容。预览设置控制网络文件和最大文件大小。\n- 右键单击文件夹中的空白处，可看到视图、排序依据、新建、粘贴以及该文件夹的其他命令。\n- Ctrl+H 显示或隐藏隐藏文件。Alt+Shift+P 或 Alt+P 显示详细信息窗格，F9 显示导航窗格。\n- F11 将窗口显示为全屏；再次按下可恢复窗口原样。\n- Ctrl+加号、Ctrl+减号和 Ctrl+0 更改文本大小。"

