#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "1. Click Make OpenXplorer default, then Enable in Show in folder from browsers. Both folder/SMB handlers and the optional FileManager1 service are configured for your account."
msgstr "1. 点击“设为 OpenXplorer 默认”，然后在“来自浏览器的在文件夹中显示”中点击“启用”。文件夹/SMB 处理程序和可选的 FileManager1 服务都会为你的账户配置好。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "2. Close other file-manager windows. If Show in folder says waiting, log out of Zorin and log back in. OpenXplorer does not terminate Files or Dolphin."
msgstr "2. 关闭其他文件管理器窗口。如果“在文件夹中显示”显示为等待中，请退出 Zorin 登录再重新登录。OpenXplorer 不会结束 Files 或 Dolphin。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "3. Clicking a ZIP filename in Brave opens its ZIP handler, not your folder handler. Turn on ZIP files in Default apps to change that association. Restart Brave after changing it."
msgstr "3. 在 Brave 中点击 ZIP 文件名会打开它的 ZIP 处理程序，而不是你的文件夹处理程序。在默认应用中开启“ZIP 文件”即可更改该关联。更改后请重启 Brave。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "4. Downloads → Show in folder is a different action. Test, in Show in folder from browsers, checks FileManager1, not Brave or its portal. The status must show OpenXplorer as the owner, not just enabled."
msgstr "4. 下载 → 在文件夹中显示是另一种操作。“来自浏览器的在文件夹中显示”中的“测试”检查的是 FileManager1，而不是 Brave 或其门户。状态中必须显示 OpenXplorer 为所有者，而不只是已启用。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "5. Flatpak/Snap Brave or a remembered portal choice may still use another handler. In a chooser, select OpenXplorer. Do not disable your desktop portal: file-picker dialogs remain system dialogs."
msgstr "5. Flatpak/Snap 版 Brave 或记住的门户选择可能仍会使用其他处理程序。在选择器中选择 OpenXplorer。不要禁用桌面门户：文件选择对话框仍是系统对话框。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "6. Pin the installed OpenXplorer folder icon to your Zorin panel. Right-click it → Open windows… lists existing windows; New window creates another. Super+E is a separate system keyboard shortcut; on KDE Plasma, the Default apps switch Super+E opens OpenXplorer gives it to OpenXplorer after you log out and back in."
msgstr "6. 将已安装的 OpenXplorer 文件夹图标固定到 Zorin 面板。右键点击它 → “打开窗口…”会列出已有窗口；“新建窗口”会再开一个。Super+E 是独立的系统快捷键；在 KDE Plasma 上，默认应用中的“Super+E 打开 OpenXplorer”开关会在你退出登录并重新登录后把它交给 OpenXplorer。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "Make OpenXplorer Zorin's file explorer and Brave's Show in folder, and undo it."
msgstr "让 OpenXplorer 成为 Zorin 的文件资源管理器并响应 Brave 的“在文件夹中显示”，以及撤销该设置。"

#: crates/ox-app/src/settings_page/troubleshooting.rs
msgid "Restore previous removes OpenXplorer's unmodified per-user reveal/autostart files and restores recorded file handlers. No system packages are removed."
msgstr "“恢复之前”会移除 OpenXplorer 未修改过的用户级 reveal/autostart 文件，并恢复记录的文件处理程序。不会移除任何系统软件包。"

