msgid "File Explorer"
msgstr "文件资源管理器"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.desktop packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.desktop
msgid "File Explorer;file explorer;File Manager;files;folders;SMB;NAS;network;archives;"
msgstr "文件资源管理器;文件管理器;文件;文件夹;SMB;NAS;网络;压缩包;"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.desktop packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "OpenXplorer Native Preview"
msgstr "OpenXplorer 原生预览版"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.desktop packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "Preview of the native OpenXplorer file manager"
msgstr "原生 OpenXplorer 文件管理器的预览版"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "A name being renamed in place no longer closes when you use its own right-click menu, such as Paste or Select All, or switch to another window. Item check boxes are off by default, so a selected item is only highlighted, as in Windows; View > Item check boxes turns them back on. A search word found only in a name's extension no longer matches, so pd no longer finds every PDF."
msgstr ""

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "A preview of the next OpenXplorer, drawn with native GTK 4 widgets instead of a web page. It browses local folders, SMB shares and connected phones in the familiar tabbed window styled after Windows 11 File Explorer."
msgstr "下一代 OpenXplorer 的预览版，使用原生 GTK 4 控件绘制，而不是网页。它可以在熟悉的、风格与 Windows 11 文件资源管理器一致的标签页窗口中浏览本地文件夹、SMB 共享和已连接的手机。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Adds Windows Explorer's Group by, separate from the sort, and Folder Options' Apply to all folders and Reset folders. Copies ask about one unreadable file instead of failing the folder and about names Windows cannot use, TAR archives get the ZIP safety limits, read-only and disconnected drives say so, and the Open and Save dialogs no longer freeze or get stuck."
msgstr "新增 Windows 资源管理器中与排序相互独立的分组依据，以及文件夹选项中的应用到所有文件夹和重置文件夹。复制时会针对一个无法读取的文件进行询问，而不是让整个文件夹失败，并会询问 Windows 无法使用的名称；TAR 压缩包也会应用 ZIP 的安全限制；只读和已断开的驱动器会明确提示；打开和保存对话框不再卡死或挂起。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Adds item check boxes as in Windows 11 and a redesigned Settings page with eight pages, a search across all of them and details in ⓘ bubbles. Open and Save dialogs no longer wait on network shares and say why Save cannot save, and a folder's expand arrow stays inside its row's highlight. Dropping files onto a file on a Windows drive or share no longer runs it unless it really is a program, and asks first."
msgstr "新增与 Windows 11 相同的项目复选框，以及重新设计的设置页面：包含八个页面、可跨全部页面的搜索，并在 ⓘ 气泡中显示详情。打开和保存对话框不再因网络共享而等待，并会说明无法保存的原因；文件夹的展开箭头不再超出其所在行的高亮范围。把文件拖放到 Windows 驱动器或共享上的某个文件时，除非它确实是一个程序，否则不再运行它，并且会先询问。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Brave's downloads, its Save page as and Save as PDF, and its upload dialogs can open OpenXplorer's own Open and Save dialogs, also when the desktop portal reads its settings from a different folder, and the Brave sync can make Brave ask where to save each download. A Save dialog names the file for the type chosen in it. By default, an unselected item's check box shows on hover only while Ctrl is held, as in Windows Explorer, and an experimental, off-by-default option indexes frequently opened folders for instant search. Compressed archives, launcher previews during a drag and search results now have memory limits, and the share mount helper only rolls back what its own setup changed. Large cached folders, fast file operations and custom folder icons take less time."
msgstr "Brave 的下载、它的页面另存为和另存为 PDF，以及它的上传对话框，都可以打开 OpenXplorer 自己的打开和保存对话框，即使桌面门户从其他文件夹读取设置也一样；Brave 同步还可以让 Brave 在每次下载时询问保存位置。保存对话框会根据在其中选择的类型来命名文件。默认情况下，未选中项目的复选框仅在按住 Ctrl 时于鼠标悬停时显示，与 Windows 资源管理器相同；一个实验性且默认关闭的选项会为经常打开的文件夹建立索引，以实现即时搜索。压缩包、拖动过程中的启动器预览和搜索结果现在都有内存限制，共享挂载助手只会回滚其自身设置所更改的内容。大型缓存文件夹、快速文件操作和自定义文件夹图标所需的时间更少。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Copies, drags and new folders work as in Windows Explorer: a copy is named “name - Copy”, a plain drag moves within a drive and copies to another, and New folder makes the folder at once to rename in place. Properties shows Size on disk, a rename that changes the extension asks first, and Super+E can open OpenXplorer on KDE Plasma. An empty folder looks as it does in Windows and takes right-click, paste and drops, New and Paste are off in a folder you cannot write to, Apply to all folders uses the choices in the dialog, and Show after moving items to the Recycle Bin opens it."
msgstr "复制、拖动和新建文件夹的行为与 Windows 资源管理器相同：复制的文件命名为“name - Copy”，在驱动器内直接拖动是移动，拖到其他驱动器则是复制，新建文件夹会立即创建文件夹以便就地重命名。属性中显示磁盘占用大小，更改扩展名的重命名会先询问，并且在 KDE Plasma 上可以用 Super+E 打开 OpenXplorer。空文件夹的外观与 Windows 相同，并接受右键单击、粘贴和拖放；在无法写入的文件夹中，新建和粘贴处于关闭状态；应用到所有文件夹会使用对话框中的选择；“将项目移到回收站后显示”会打开回收站。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "File Manager"
msgstr "文件管理器"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "First packaged native preview of the GTK 4 interface, for trying it beside the current OpenXplorer."
msgstr "GTK 4 界面的首个打包原生预览版，可与当前的 OpenXplorer 并排试用。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Folder Options replaces Adjust view display style, with Windows' General and View tabs, and Windows Explorer's Ctrl+E, Ctrl+D, F11 and Alt+P work. The Share button emails the selected files through the desktop's email app. Delete moves items to the Recycle Bin wherever it works and asks only about items that cannot go there. As in Windows Explorer, a file operation that succeeds or is cancelled says nothing and sends no desktop notification, while failures, and failures not yet shown when you cancel, are still reported; read-only drives are not singled out, and New and Paste stay on in folders you cannot write to; Undo stays on Ctrl+Z and the folder menu. Keys meant for an open dialog no longer reach the files behind it, menus show in full when they fit on the monitor, submenus open in the same popup, a cut item pasted into its own folder stays put, and a failed copy names the real file."
msgstr "文件夹选项取代了调整视图显示样式，包含 Windows 的常规和查看标签页，Windows 资源管理器的 Ctrl+E、Ctrl+D、F11 和 Alt+P 也可用。共享按钮会通过桌面自带的电子邮件应用把所选文件作为邮件发送。删除在可行的情况下会把项目移到回收站，并且只针对无法移入回收站的项目进行询问。与 Windows 资源管理器相同，成功或被取消的文件操作不会给出任何提示，也不会发送桌面通知，但失败以及取消时尚未显示的失败仍会报告；只读驱动器不再被单独提示，且在无法写入的文件夹中新建和粘贴保持可用；撤销仍在 Ctrl+Z 和文件夹菜单中。为已打开对话框准备的按键不再传递给它后面的文件，菜单在显示器放得下时会完整显示，子菜单在同一个弹出窗口中打开，剪切的项目粘贴到其自身所在的文件夹时保持原样，复制失败时会指出真实的文件。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Make OpenXplorer default also sends other apps' Open and Save dialogs to OpenXplorer, and GTK 3 apps use them too after the next login. Format on a removable drive opens OpenXplorer's own Format dialog instead of GNOME Disks, and Enter in Extract all extracts. Deleting many files on a share asks the server about each file once instead of three times. A move between drives keeps the source files of a folder it skipped partway, Undo asks first when it cannot check a whole copy, signing out of a server forgets its passwords on every port, and the Recycle Bin and search results no longer show stale items."
msgstr "将 OpenXplorer 设为默认还会把其他应用的打开和保存对话框交给 OpenXplorer，GTK 3 应用在下次登录后也会使用它们。对可移动驱动器执行格式化会打开 OpenXplorer 自己的格式化对话框，而不是 GNOME Disks；在全部解压缩中按 Enter 即可解压。在共享上删除大量文件时，每个文件只需向服务器询问一次，而不是三次。在驱动器之间移动时，中途跳过的文件夹会保留其源文件；撤销在无法检查整个复制时会先询问；从服务器退出登录会忘记它在所有端口上的密码；回收站和搜索结果不再显示过期的项目。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "NAS"
msgstr "NAS"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "OpenXplorer contributors"
msgstr "OpenXplorer 贡献者"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "Preview build of OpenXplorer 2.0.0 under its own application ID."
msgstr "OpenXplorer 2.0.0 的预览版构建，使用其独立的应用 ID。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "Preview build of OpenXplorer 2.0.1 under its own application ID."
msgstr "OpenXplorer 2.0.1 的预览版构建，使用其独立的应用 ID。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "Preview build of OpenXplorer 2.0.2 under its own application ID."
msgstr "OpenXplorer 2.0.2 的预览版构建，使用其独立的应用 ID。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "SMB"
msgstr "SMB"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml
msgid "The preview is incomplete and runs beside the current OpenXplorer without replacing it. It never changes file associations, browser preferences or network mounts."
msgstr "此预览版并不完整，它与当前的 OpenXplorer 并行运行而不会取代它。它从不会更改文件关联、浏览器首选项或网络挂载。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "ZIP"
msgstr "ZIP"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "files"
msgstr "文件"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "folders"
msgstr "文件夹"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.Native.metainfo.xml packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "network"
msgstr "网络"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.desktop packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Explorer-style local and SMB file manager"
msgstr "资源管理器风格的本地和 SMB 文件管理器"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Add explicit Replace or Skip conflict handling and fix transfers to connected phones that do not support Unix permission changes."
msgstr "新增显式的替换或跳过冲突处理，并修复向不支持 Unix 权限更改的已连接手机传输的问题。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Add opt-in in-app updates and fix folder permission preservation, backup protection, keyboard activation, tab navigation, cached search and device ZIP extraction."
msgstr "新增需主动开启的应用内更新，并修复文件夹权限保留、备份保护、键盘激活、标签页导航、缓存搜索和设备上的 ZIP 解压。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Adds a Compact view, split panes, a folder tree, thumbnail previews, per-folder view properties, grouping, session restore, independent transfer jobs with undo and batch rename, SFTP, FTP, WebDAV and NFS locations, content search and saved searches, and optional Open and Save dialogs for other applications, KDE's own apps included."
msgstr "新增紧凑视图、分屏、文件夹树、缩略图预览、按文件夹保存的视图属性、分组、会话恢复、可撤销的独立传输任务和批量重命名、SFTP、FTP、WebDAV 和 NFS 位置、内容搜索和已保存的搜索，以及供其他应用（包括 KDE 自带应用）使用的可选打开和保存对话框。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Browse local folders, SMB shares and connected phones in a tabbed window styled after Windows 11 File Explorer, with light and dark appearances, a resizable sidebar, indexed filename search and ZIP browsing."
msgstr "在风格与 Windows 11 文件资源管理器一致的标签页窗口中浏览本地文件夹、SMB 共享和已连接的手机，支持浅色和深色外观、可调整宽度的侧边栏、带索引的文件名搜索和 ZIP 浏览。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Display the native app layout immediately during startup instead of a centered message and spinner, while preserving startup recovery."
msgstr "启动时立即显示原生应用布局，而不是居中消息和加载指示器，同时保留启动恢复。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "First stable release. Middle-click folders to open tabs in the background, tear tabs out onto the desktop and merge them back across windows, extract ZIP archives and open terminals in the current folder. Existing defaults remain unchanged until requested."
msgstr "首个稳定版本。中键单击文件夹可在后台打开标签页，可以把标签页拖到桌面上并跨窗口合并回去，解压 ZIP 压缩包并在当前文件夹中打开终端。现有默认设置在主动要求之前保持不变。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Fix dragging filenames containing parentheses and simplify the Software updates dialog."
msgstr "修复拖动包含括号的文件名的问题，并简化软件更新对话框。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Installation does not change file associations, browser preferences or network mounts. Making OpenXplorer the default file manager, handling Show in folder requests and the other desktop integrations stay off until you turn them on in Settings."
msgstr "安装不会更改文件关联、浏览器首选项或网络挂载。将 OpenXplorer 设为默认文件管理器、处理在文件夹中显示请求以及其他桌面集成，在你于设置中开启之前都保持关闭。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Keep in-app updates working after the repository moves to the openxplorer GitHub organization."
msgstr "在仓库迁移到 openxplorer GitHub 组织后，保持应用内更新正常工作。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "OpenXplorer is now a native GTK 4 application with the same Windows 11 look. It adds Fluent icons, a categorised Settings page, undo, dropping files onto programs, tearing tabs out into new windows, and Flatpak and distribution packages. Pinned folders are indexed for search by default."
msgstr "OpenXplorer 现在是一个具有相同 Windows 11 外观的原生 GTK 4 应用。它新增了 Fluent 图标、分类的设置页面、撤销、把文件拖放到程序上、把标签页拖出成新窗口，以及 Flatpak 和发行版软件包。固定的文件夹默认会被索引以便搜索。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Place the update action beside the bottom-right view controls and remove the stable-release status indicator."
msgstr "将更新操作放在右下角视图控件旁边，并移除稳定版状态指示器。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "Show connected Android, camera/PTP and iPhone devices in the sidebar and This PC, with native GIO browsing and hot-plug refresh."
msgstr "在侧边栏和此电脑中显示已连接的 Android、相机/PTP 和 iPhone 设备，并提供原生 GIO 浏览和热插拔刷新。"

#: packaging/data/io.winspace.Development.metainfo.xml
msgid "ZIPs can open like folders, and Extract all, the Open and Save dialogs and Shift with Delete work as in Windows. Adds Windows 11's Compact view, collapsible This PC and Network sections and an option to hide the navigation pane's expand arrows."
msgstr "ZIP 压缩包可以像文件夹一样打开，全部解压缩、打开和保存对话框以及 Shift+Delete 的行为与 Windows 相同。新增 Windows 11 的紧凑视图、可折叠的此电脑和网络分区，以及隐藏导航窗格展开箭头的选项。"
